// Open chute section (UnifiedPipes; README "Unified pipes"): a copper or lead plate folded on the
// press brake into a U, open along the top where the seam will be (the game's chute section's 8 x 8
// walls without its top, about 6.5 long, so two fold end to end within the brake's one-block edge).
// Made only on the press brake, two to a plate; two,
// soldered shut with two solder bars and a soldering iron, make two of the game's chute sections
// (recipes/grid/chutesection.json). Marked disabled with the switch off.
